{% comment %}
  Homepage UGC video row ("Älskad av tusentals"), rendered by sections/fm-home-tabs.liquid (setting "Show the UGC
  video row") and on live's homepage by the "Senaste dofterna" popular-products section.

  Copy theme, 15.11.2026: the reels mirror the ones on the bestseller page (/collections/bestseller-singles, template
  collection.collection-lander-v3, product-grid blocks fuel05_td_1-7 desktop / fuel05_tm_1-7 mobile, as on the live
  theme that day). Like the bestseller page there is a desktop build and a phone build, each shown only at its own
  widths (.fuel05-ugc--home-desktop / --home-mobile in fuel05-ugc.css, the same 750px switch as the PDP and grid
  builds). A hidden build never comes on screen, so fuel05-ugc.js never arms it and its clips never load.

  Desktop, in grid order: 03_Nathalie-Erickson (No. 438W), brand_EmelieS (No. 469W), 08_Joacim-Erickson (No. 372),
  brand_NathalieE (No. 469W), 06_Amanda-Eklund (no product), Ebba_Wernlund_LeMale247 (Cherry Vanilla),
  brand_JoacimE (No. 360M).
  Phone: brand_SofiaK _sdr (No. 437W), Ebba_Wernlund_LeMale247 (Bergamot Pepper Ambroxan), brand_EmelieS (No. 360M),
  brand_NathalieE (No. 469W), brand_SofiaK _sdr (4x 100 ml), brand_EbbaW (Cherry Vanilla), brand_JoacimE (No. 360M).
  Cherry Vanilla, No. 437W and Bergamot Pepper Ambroxan are unpublished (15.11), so those tiles show no product pill,
  exactly as on the bestseller page; the pill comes back by itself if the product is published again.

  A snippet has no settings to hold a video pick, so the URLs are hard-coded: the transcodes live renders for those
  Files videos (480p where the clip has a 480p rendition, else its smallest). The SofiaK clips are the _sdr Files
  entries (the originals were iPhone HLG HDR and blew out on iOS). If the bestseller tiles change, refresh these from
  that page.

  Usage:
  {% render 'fuel05-ugc-home-row' %}
{% endcomment %}

{{ 'fuel05-ugc.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<script src="{{ 'fuel05-ugc.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>

{%- capture fuel05_home_header -%}
    <div class="fuel05-ugc__header">
      <h2 class="fuel05-ugc__heading">Älskad av tusentals</h2>
      <div class="fuel05-ugc__nav">
        <button class="fuel05-ugc__arrow fuel05-ugc__arrow--prev" type="button" aria-label="Föregående">
          <svg preserveAspectRatio="none" overflow="visible" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M9 4L17 12L9 20" stroke="black" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </button>
        <button class="fuel05-ugc__arrow fuel05-ugc__arrow--next" type="button" aria-label="Nästa">
          <svg preserveAspectRatio="none" overflow="visible" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M9 4L17 12L9 20" stroke="black" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
{%- endcapture -%}

